+- `cases/eplus_certify.py`, `window_object` and `delayed_loss_scan`.
+- `cases/d25_eplus.py`, the D25 completion/replay wrapper.
+- `cases/d23_eplus.json` and `cases/d25_eplus.json`, the legacy result
+  fixtures.

