+~~~
+
+Also reproduce:
+
+- the Row-24 90-entry symbol digest
+  `ab5ee038b118ba6d0b6303c6b2b55b110dc9872c203e1c6b2d60044458e69d29`;
+- its eta support \(2,5,\ldots,26\) and rank-four Schur block;
