+- **CONJECTURE CYCLIC-30:** no additional all-depth output stream;
+- **CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30:** universal two-sided pristine/emitted bridge;
+- **CONJECTURE FILTER-30:** the full source-dependent normalization is
