+ \frac{\partial [t^{36}\eta^{29}]\mathcal E}
+      {\partial\,\mathrm{tf1}_{48}}
+ =-\frac{147880611647231905314470776689}{1024}.
+\]
+
+This byte equality belongs to `LEGACY_BAND40_REGRESSION`. A genuine D43
