+| quantity | required result |
+|---|---|
+| points | 36 |
+| window rank | 117 at 27 points; 115 at 9 |
+| \(\delta^+(1)\) | 25 at 27; 26 at 9 |
+| \(\underline\ell_{40}\) | 37 at all 36 |
