+For even \(12\le k<42\), `xmodel/sol-algkill.md` proves the pure-y
+first-occurrence rule
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+ O_k&=\{\mathrm{tf1,tf2,tg1,tg2}\}_{k+27},\\
+ E_k&=\{\mathrm{tf1,tf2,tg1,tg2,tg01,tg02}\}_{k+32}.
+\end{aligned}                                               \tag{6.1}
+\]
