+| pristine row \(k\) | four ordinary tails \(k+27\) | all six tails \(k+32\) | status |
+|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| 26 | 53 | 58 | proved occurrence law |
+| 28 | 55 | 60 | proved occurrence law |
